From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jose Martins <josemartins90@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 19 May 2026 18:38:35 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 03/13] riscv: sbi: drop sbi_set_timer helper

Upstream's riscv_supervisor_timer.c (newer than this branch's base)
defines its own file-local `static void sbi_set_timer(uint64_t)` and
includes <zephyr/arch/riscv/sbi.h>. Our convenience helper had the same
name with a conflicting (int / non-static) signature, so the build
fails with a "previous declaration of 'sbi_set_timer' with type
'int(uint64_t)'" diagnostic when the supervisor timer driver compiles.

The helper was a convenience wrapper around sbi_ecall(SBI_EXT_TIME,
SBI_FUNC_SET_TIMER, ...). Callers can use sbi_ecall directly, so just
drop the helper. The riscv_supervisor_timer driver is already
self-sufficient.

Signed-off-by: Jose Martins <josemartins90@gmail.com>
(cherry picked from commit fe3c401ddf3267db418a6009fae81934d7d6609a)
---
 arch/riscv/core/sbi.c           | 9 ---------
 include/zephyr/arch/riscv/sbi.h | 8 --------
 2 files changed, 17 deletions(-)

diff --git a/arch/riscv/core/sbi.c b/arch/riscv/core/sbi.c
index f8abe5f3254..565c64c8ba7 100644
--- a/arch/riscv/core/sbi.c
+++ b/arch/riscv/core/sbi.c
@@ -35,12 +35,3 @@ struct sbiret sbi_ecall(int ext, int fid, unsigned long arg0,
 	ret.value = a1;
 	return ret;
 }
-
-int sbi_set_timer(uint64_t stime_value)
-{
-	struct sbiret ret;
-
-	ret = sbi_ecall(SBI_EXT_TIME, SBI_FUNC_SET_TIMER,
-			(unsigned long)stime_value, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0);
-	return ret.error;
-}
diff --git a/include/zephyr/arch/riscv/sbi.h b/include/zephyr/arch/riscv/sbi.h
index 2cad3c157ac..271ac7a5c6c 100644
--- a/include/zephyr/arch/riscv/sbi.h
+++ b/include/zephyr/arch/riscv/sbi.h
@@ -72,14 +72,6 @@ struct sbiret sbi_ecall(int ext, int fid, unsigned long arg0,
 			unsigned long arg1, unsigned long arg2,
 			unsigned long arg3, unsigned long arg4,
 			unsigned long arg5);
-
-/**
- * @brief Program the next supervisor timer interrupt deadline.
- *
- * @param stime_value Absolute deadline, in mtime ticks.
- * @return 0 on success, non-zero SBI error code otherwise.
- */
-int sbi_set_timer(uint64_t stime_value);
 #endif /* !_ASMLANGUAGE */
 
 #endif /* ZEPHYR_INCLUDE_ARCH_RISCV_SBI_H_ */
